    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAtr">IV Atr</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Si portireva vel tungravio compellet aliquem vel alius praepositus quod teloneum supertenuerit, et homo respondeat quod nullum tolneum concelaverit quod iuste dare debuisset, iuret hoc se VII° et sit quietus.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If the town-reeve or the village reeve or any other official accuses anyone of having withheld toll, and the man replies that he has kept back no toll which it was his legal duty to pay, he shall swear to this with 6 others and shall be quit of the charge.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
